<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 1.3 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 1.3 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 1.3 billion pounds for auction on June 11 and issue on June 12 when 91-day bills worth 872.950 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.923 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 pounds)</p>
</text>
